{"title": "Bibberbang", "pageid": 23265, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bibberbang", "categories": ["Resistant to all Piercing", "Resistant to all Necrotic", "Resistant to all Radiant", "Immune to all Poison", "Immune to all Psychic", "Vulnerable to Fire", "Environmental objects", "Mushrooms"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Bibberbang</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Bibberbang.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bibberbang.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Bibberbang.png/300px-Bibberbang.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Bibberbang.png/300px-Bibberbang.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Bibberbang.png/599px-Bibberbang.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Bibberbang.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"188\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-panel-scroll-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<ul class=\"pi-section-navigation\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"pi-section-tab pi-item-spacing pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-label\">Balanced</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"pi-section-contents\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"pi-section-content pi-section-active\" data-ref=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Balanced Difficulty Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"hp\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secon